Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:07.74,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,355.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,5700,6900)}Episode 22
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:07.74,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.949,550.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,5700,6900)}The Battle of Guāndù - Part Two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My childhood friend, I never thought we'd meet like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I failed to follow a greater lord, \Nthus I was under that wicked Yuán Shào.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My words ignored and my ideas disregarded, thus I chose to abandon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}That's why I come to an old friend, \N hoping I can be of service!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Your arrival is a blessing from Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Zǐyuǎn, what plan did you have for me to defeat Yuan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.38,0:01:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I had told Yuan Shao to target Xǔdū, your most precious territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and attack you from both front and rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yuan Shao followed your plan, \NI would have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.06,0:01:36.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988.354,466.363)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,3740,3940)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How much grain is there left in your camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We could manage for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:45.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.65,443.182)}Xǔ Yōu\NStyled: Zǐyuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only jesting. We've only got half a year left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyuan, why act like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back! Sit down, Ziyuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to you in sincerity,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you'd deceive me so. You disappoint me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not hide from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The grain in the camp is only enough for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.26,0:02:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyuan, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Many have said you were devious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you know that war{\i1} is{\i0} devious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell this to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only got one month of grain left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you lie to me! You're already out of grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You sent someone towards Xǔdū to urge the grain shipments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The letter fell into my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you already know the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly ask for your strategy against Yuán!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Away! No one enters my tent without my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Esteemed sire, you fight with a lone army against a vast enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you ask a plan for a quick victory?\N Is that not a path to suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want to say, Ziyuan, please say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My one plan, in only three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,could have Yuan Shao's 700,000 man army fall apart on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Would my esteemed lord like to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you wish to say, I will heed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know well that my esteemed lord excels at war,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and that he surely knows what's most critical in defeating an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sever his supply route?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Severing his supply route is like choking his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet to defeat Yuan Shao, \Nmerely cutting him from his supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}may still not lead him to his downfall, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Ziyuan, there is no need to beat around the bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yuan Shao's provisions for all 700,000 of his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}All of it is stored in Wūcháo, that is his critical weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that's the "throat," then surely\NYuan Shao has placed heavy guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we feasibly strike it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I say we can beat Yuan Shao in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Although Wūcháo is very important,\N Yuan Shao hardly pays notice to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually sent Chúnyú Qióng to garrison it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That Chunyu Qiong is a careless drunkard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so isn't that like offering Wūcháo\N to you with open palms, my esteemed sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask, Ziyuan, how should our army seize Wūcháo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}It won't be hard! \NSelect only your elite cavalry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}disguise one \Nas Yuan Shao's officer Jiǎng Qí,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and head towards Wūcháo to "protect" it, \Nusing this chance to burn its supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thus in three days, \NYuan's army will be in disarray.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I'll head to Wūcháo personally!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, seizing supplies is risky! \NYou should not lead the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:50.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.65,486.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2660,2980)}Xǔ Chǔ\NStyled: Zhòngkāng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Chancellor goes personally, there may be disaster! Please reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.65,486.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2660,2980)}Zhang Liáo\NStyled: Wényuăn
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The validity of Xǔ Yōu's plan is still unknown! \NYou should not be so trusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wūcháo is Yuan Shao's granary. \NHow could he not defend it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Xǔ Yōu may be duplicitous. Do not go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, how could 5,000 men beat\N Chunyu Qiong's tens of thousands?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, 5,000 elite soldiers are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Wūcháo is the weak point \Nof Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Raiding his supplies is what \Ndetermines our final outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Xǔ Yōu's defection is Heaven's will helping me defeat Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}We cannot remain here\N without supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To disregard Xǔ Yōu's plan\N is no different than waiting for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Moreover, raiding the supplies \Nhas occupied my mind for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Gentlemen, disperse your doubts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go, I fear Yuan Shao will exploit this feint to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made my decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please give the order!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When dusk parts, we shall head towards Wūcháo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.89,0:08:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Relay my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise a fire on all sides! We shall strike together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:09:00.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968.101,489.546)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1380,1740)}Chúnyú Qióng\NStyled: Zhòngjiān
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General, look! Wūcháo is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wūcháo is in danger! Have the rear troops save the provisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Suī Yuánjìn and Zhào Ruì\N are leading troops to attack us from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers, keep charging forward with all your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal with them when they get behind us! Now onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Yuan's troops are already here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rearguard, turn and fight to the death!\N Force your way through!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Wūcháo is in flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:46.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310.549,489.546)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:53.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(286.245,454.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2100,2420)}Gāo Lǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Zhāng Hé and I are willing to rescue it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay, my lord! If they're seizing the supplies, then Cáo Cāo must be there himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:01.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(957.3,495)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2780,3140)}Guō Tú\NStyled: Gōngzé
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In his absence, his camp must be empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We should send troops to attack their camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon hearing of this, Cao Cao will rush there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His troops will be exhausted. Thus we can crush him, and inflict a great loss upon him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Sūn Bìn's {\i1}"Besiege Wèi to rescue Zhào"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:14.30,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Sūn Bìn of the Warring States period suggested sieging Wèi to distract the troops attacking Zhào, thus rescuing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.82,0:12:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Cao Cao is cunning, if he left camp he would've already made preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If we attack the camp and fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,when they return from Wūcháo, \Nwe'll be caught in a pincer attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That would only exasperate our situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao only cares about larceny. \NHow could he spare troops for his camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! My lord, make your \Nchoice now, and raid their camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! Wūcháo is more important!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of your plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He and Gāo Lǎn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead 5,000 men towards \NGuāndù and raid their camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Order Jiang Qi to take 10,000 men towards Wūcháo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,were you sober last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are indeed sober, raise your eyes and see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that {\i1}this{\i0} is your dear, heavily guarded Wūcháo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:13:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as Ziyuan said:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Wūcháo not be lost \Nwhen Yuan Shao sent you to defend it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Men?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tattoo Chunyu Qiong's face and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him return to Yuan Shao, to show his humiliation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Have all regiments disguise as Chunyu Qiong's \Ndefeated soldiers and rush back to Guāndù!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If any come to save Wūcháo, kill them along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(337.553,510)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2020,2340)}Xiàhóu Yuān\NStyled: Miàocái
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General, if we go any further, I fear \Nwe'll be recognized by the Yuan troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Which group are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Chunyu Qiong's subordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We were defeated by Cao Cao's forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(467.173,350.454)\fade(255,0,255,0,350,1940,2340)}Jiǎng Qí
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Onward to Wūcháo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Qi, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We surrender! We surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Send men to disguise as Jiang Qi's \Nsubordinates to Yuan Shao's main camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him Jiang Qi has already defeated our forces and recovered Wūcháo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry back to Guāndù!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lift your head for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,... they are words...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What words?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It says... {\i1}the Drunkard of Wūcháo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You drunk? You drunk!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you drink your fill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Drown him in wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him drink his fill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.18,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, General Jiang Qi sent a messenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already defeated the Cao troops at Wūcháo, and recaptured it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... then... then what about Guāndù?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He and Gao Lan are currently engaged in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The results are unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... then send more troops to Guāndù!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must take Guāndù!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:17:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as Zhang He said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He and Gao Lan's persistent attack failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao got them from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Zhang He and Gao Lan now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,According to defeated troops, they broke out with a hundred or so cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Their current location is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If they return,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,how could our lord not want to blame you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did those two survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How fares Guāndù?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not going well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it is like that, does Cao Cao have an elite force at Guāndù?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, are you still unaware of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Guāndù had small defenses,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but Zhang He and Gao Lan had no will to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two have long wanted to surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They intentionally refused to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They dare to mock me!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency! Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:53.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(291.646,338.182)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Guō Tú sent me to report this to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The lord is furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:19:59.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(873.586,407.728)}Gāo Lǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He said you two didn't even try to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants you executed as an example to the entire army!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said we didn't fight!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency, so I wouldn't dare remain here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful my generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We fought with all we had,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,yet this is what we get for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lordship's messenger has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Salutations to two generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, our lord has asked you two to return to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has our lord summoned us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.74,0:20:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:20:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao listens only to slander and lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be defeated sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we sit and wait for death?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to surrender to Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,By the Chancellor's orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He and Gao Lan may enter the camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.46,0:22:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The surrendering general is the one at Guāndù who
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,matched against Zhāng Liáo in a fifty-bout duel, Zhang He!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall go out to meet them personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He and Gao Lan coming to defect so suddenly is suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you really meet them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall treat them graciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If they possess ulterior motives, I will change their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, since you've come from afar to join me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you have gained my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.70,0:23:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.34,0:23:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You generals joining me is like Weizi leaving Yīn(-Shāng) and Hán Xìn joining Hàn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.46,0:24:02.74,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Weizi was a duke known for his virtue who joined the Zhou to defeat \Nthe Shang dynasty, and Han Xin was instrumental in the rise of the Han dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.34,0:24:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now now, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone else who spreads rumors and disturbs morale,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.82,0:24:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,beat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:36.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.903,504.546)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2420,2780)}Yuán Tán\NStyled: Xiǎnsī
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.14,0:25:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.74,0:25:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here instead \Nof staying in your camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.94,0:25:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.14,0:25:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a few defeats won't decide our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.94,0:25:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I know you're upset, but you shoudn't drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.46,0:26:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Xǔ Yōu left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.46,0:26:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He and Gao Lan have betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the people are aggrieved!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.78,0:26:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.98,0:26:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! He died! He died!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.94,0:26:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.38,0:26:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.82,0:26:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Have this ill-tongued bastard taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.66,0:26:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And flog him 300 times!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.58,0:26:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.26,0:27:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord! Spare—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.38,0:27:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, ask him who died!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.90,0:27:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.34,0:27:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Scum! I want him beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.34,0:27:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.06,0:27:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.46,0:27:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.58,0:27:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.26,0:27:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.58,0:27:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.46,0:27:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We are falling apart, not due to \Nthe enemy, but due to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.34,0:27:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.38,0:27:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you should rest now for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.26,0:28:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I've discovered someone else \Nwho seeks to disturb our military's morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.82,0:28:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,An officer in the rear camp said to someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.86,0:28:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"At the rate things are going, it won't take long
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,for us to be defeated by Cao Cao."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.58,0:28:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Every word and sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.10,0:28:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize that man! Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.74,0:28:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let his body be shown to the entire army! Anyone else who disturbs morale,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.10,0:28:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone else who spreads rumors, I'll kill them myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.70,0:28:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.98,0:28:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.14,0:29:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must ensure our units are on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.34,0:29:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is most important to our military's morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.62,0:29:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.54,0:29:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.94,0:31:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.98,0:31:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, we defeat the Yuan's forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.86,0:31:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Surround them from all sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.98,0:31:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.42,0:32:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Tián Fēng!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.70,0:32:26.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.903,504.546)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1820,2140)}Tián Fēng\NStyled: Yuánhào
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.62,0:32:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.78,0:32:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Tian, my utmost felicitations to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.06,0:32:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you congratulating me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Yuan is returning from Guandu in great defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.42,0:32:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,700,000 troops were all annihilated!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.26,0:33:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beginning, you urged our lordship \Nnot to raise an army so large so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.26,0:33:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've been proven right! Our lordship is returning!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.26,0:33:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't this mean getting back your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.50,0:33:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Tian, what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.02,0:33:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will die soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.34,0:33:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Tian Feng!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.62,0:33:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.54,0:33:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}General Yuan may seem lenient,\Nyet he is spiteful,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.54,0:33:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he does not heed loyalty and honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.98,0:33:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If he had won, in his bliss I would be pardoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.06,0:34:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet he lost, and he will meet with me in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.90,0:34:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}There is no hope for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.54,0:34:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Tian Feng, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.22,0:34:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.30,0:34:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,By our lord's orders, we shall take Tian Feng's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.34,0:34:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Tian Feng!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Yuan Shao escaped \Nwith only 800 of his remaining cavalry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.90,0:35:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Heaven's will! They are doomed to have an arduous escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.90,0:35:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jǔ Shòu?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Ju Shou!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.86,0:35:24.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(946.498,450)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1500,1860)}Jǔ Shòu
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Ju Shou.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.82,0:35:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry. Release this gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.38,0:35:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.50,0:35:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.02,0:36:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Benchu had no wit and never used thy words.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.06,0:36:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the fervor for the ignorant?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.06,0:36:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I received you, nothing on this realm could worry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.02,0:36:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you have great ability, \Nbut could not find a wise lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.50,0:36:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I value your knowledge and talent, \N I would like to achieve greatness with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.50,0:36:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I would enjoy your tutelage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.62,0:37:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Build a tomb for Master Ju \Non the banks of the Yellow River.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.90,0:37:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.90,0:37:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so rattled about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.70,0:37:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Chancellor, people within Xǔdū have sent secret messages to Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.06,0:37:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The letters were written \Nin most sycophantic words.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.58,0:37:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.38,0:37:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Chancellor can mark down every name on these letters, then arrest and execute each.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.02,0:38:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Have them torched.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.42,0:38:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.10,0:38:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.50,0:38:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When Yuán Shào had the upper hand, I could barely even protect myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.82,0:38:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}... Let alone them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.70,0:38:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.06,0:38:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,These elders have come to offer wine to the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.66,0:38:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.26,0:39:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, during the reign of Emperor Huán,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.30,0:39:01.66,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Emperor Huán of Hàn, 132 – 168 CE.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.66,0:39:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}there were people who predicted that after fifty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.50,0:39:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}a certain benevolent man would find his way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.14,0:39:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fifty years have come to pass since then!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.50,0:39:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yuan Shao has burdened his people, and thus they all dislike him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.78,0:39:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, you raised a most righteous campaign
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.78,0:39:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to relieve their suffering. \NAnd in the battle of Guāndù,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.34,0:39:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}you defeated the hundred-thousand host of the Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.78,0:39:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is as predicted fifty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.06,0:39:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}It's a sign that the people may now look forward to peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.78,0:39:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.34,0:39:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't possibly receive this boon!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.86,0:39:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we were born of this yellow earth \Nand drank from the yellow river for nearly a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.14,0:39:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I deceive before this great river?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.98,0:39:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.82,0:40:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.34,0:40:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, forgive your junior for acting on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.26,0:40:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but I shall offer to this earth the wine and this water
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.58,0:40:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to nurture such kindness as yours for ten thousand years.

